msgid "Whether to add the Secure attribute to the session cookie (JSESSIONID) at startup. When blank (default), Tomcat's automatic behavior is used (Secure is added only for HTTPS requests). Set to true for production HTTPS deployments, especially when TLS is terminated at a reverse proxy. When true, the cookie is not sent over HTTP, so sessions will not be established for plain HTTP; keep it blank for localhost development. The Secure attribute is also required when SameSite=none is used. Changing this value requires a restart."
msgstr "是否在启动时为会话 Cookie（JSESSIONID）添加 Secure 属性。留空（默认）时使用 Tomcat 的自动行为（仅对 HTTPS 请求添加 Secure）。生产环境的 HTTPS 部署请设置为 true，尤其是在反向代理处终止 TLS 时。为 true 时，Cookie 不会通过 HTTP 发送，因此纯 HTTP 下无法建立会话；本地主机开发时请保持留空。使用 SameSite=none 时也需要 Secure 属性。更改此值需要重启。"

